  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.12.7\n## What's Changed\n### New Features 🎉\n* Added `sum` expression function by @olavsorl in #1817\n* Added `average` expression function by @olavsorl in #1793\n### Bug Fixes 🐛\n* Reverted Maskinporten client dependency to avoid a v8 configuration binding regression in #1833\n* Reduced noisy local studioctl configuration warnings in #1834\n### Dependencies\n* Updated `actions/checkout` to v7 in #1824\n* Updated `System.IO.Hashing` to v10 in #1829\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.12.6...v8.12.7",
